Recorded model outputs

The answers files assets/methods/*/answers_*.jsonl are the responses of
OpenAI's API (the code2tag-* and descode2tag-* methods) and of TypeSafe's API
(the jev-* methods), recorded for this project: tag lists or per-tag
probabilities, request ids, hashes and token counts, never API keys or problem
text. The near-duplicate verdicts in assets/near_duplicates/ were written by
two Claude judges, and the words that the GEPA search rewrote, in
assets/methods/jev-statement-code-gepa/tuning/, by OpenAI's gpt-6-luna, both
for this project.
